{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/161842-i-have-some-questions-about-geist-and-what-they-can-do","id":161842,"title":"I have some questions about Geist and what they can do","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-07T10:18:57-07:00","id":161842,"title":"I have some questions about Geist and what they can do","content":"I have some questions about Geist, maybe my english is poor or maybe the rule book is actually poor about it. But I find hard to understand what a Geist can do or not especially:<br /> <br /> 1) How a Geist and his Sin-eater can comunicate?<br /> <br /> 2) How a Geist can interact with the physical world?<br /> <br /> 3) A Geist can materialize himself in physical world just like ghosts?<br /> <br /> 4) A Sin-eater can use his Geist to entrust him some tasks like &quot;Go downstairs and wait for the mailman?&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T12:31:02-07:00","id":161925,"title":"","content":"1) They seem to be able to talk in each other's mind. Sin-Eaters often speak to their Geists out loud, but unsure if that is necessary. It is probably easier.<br /> 2) They cannot, beyond what they can convince the Sin-Eater to do.<br /> 3) No.<br /> 4) No<br /> <br /> The Geist is, for all intents and purposes, in the Sin-Eaters head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpa